1
00:00:00,799 --> 00:00:03,389
(Sheldon:)Oh. By the way, I was watching you sleep
for a moment.

2
00:00:03,551 --> 00:00:06,971
I noticed your snoring seems to be worse
when you're on your back.

3
00:00:07,138 --> 00:00:08,888
No. Leonard doesn't snore.

4
00:00:09,057 --> 00:00:11,557
(Sheldon:)No. I wasn't talking to Leonard.

5
00:00:13,728 --> 00:00:15,688
(Leonard:)Told you.

6
00:00:17,565 --> 00:00:21,065
(Employment Office Assistant:)So, Mr. Cooper,
you're looking for a job.

7
00:00:21,277 --> 00:00:23,407
(Sheldon:)A menial job.

8
00:00:23,988 --> 00:00:25,278
(Sheldon:)Like yours.

9
00:00:27,409 --> 00:00:29,579
(Assistant:)Why, thank you for noticing.

10
00:00:30,912 --> 00:00:33,582
(Assistant:)I'm menial employee of the month.

11
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,210
(Assistant:)Do you have a particular field in mind?

12
00:00:37,377 --> 00:00:40,257
(Sheldon:)I do. For thousands of years...

13
00:00:40,422 --> 00:00:44,012
(Sheldon:)...the lowest classes of the human race
have spent their lives laboring...

14
00:00:44,175 --> 00:00:46,595
(Sheldon:)...to erect monuments
under the lash of betters.

15
00:00:46,803 --> 00:00:50,513
(Sheldon:)Until finally they dropped down
and became one with the dust...

16
00:00:50,682 --> 00:00:52,852
(Sheldon:)...through which they trudged.

17
00:00:53,017 --> 00:00:55,307
(Sheldon:)Do you have anything like that?

18
00:00:56,938 --> 00:01:03,018
(Penny:)-No.
-Shouldn't you check your database?

